= 外交政策

外交政策では何を優先すべきか？

@fp_menu

- @improve_west
- @improve_east
- @improve_soviet
- @improve_soviet_eco
- @customs_union
- @negotiate
- @reduce_reparations
- @settle_reparations
- @expose
